# Quick Look plugins
# NOTE: glance-chamburr was removed here on 2026-09-05 — Homebrew disabled the
# cask on 2026-09-01 because it fails the macOS Gatekeeper check, so a fresh
# `brew bundle` can no longer install it. The already-installed copy still works
# and is left in place; the entries below cover the same formats reproducibly.
cask "qlmarkdown" # Quick Look previews for Markdown files. Modern .appex format. [QLMarkdown](https://github.com/sbarex/QLMarkdown)
cask "quicklook-video" # Quick Look plugin for video files. [QLVideo](https://github.com/Marginal/QLVideo)
cask "syntax-highlight" # Quick Look previews with syntax highlighting for source code. Modern .appex format. [Syntax Highlight](https://github.com/sbarex/SourceCodeSyntaxHighlight)
